  "id": "involutional",
  "term": "involutional",
  "definition": "In this psychology context, involutional refers to an excessively competitive attitude shaped by a high-pressure educational environment and reinforced by some parenting patterns. It is linked with greater stress, self-doubt, and obstacles to healthy ego identity development in adolescents.",
